---
import LegalLayout from "../../layouts/LegalLayout.astro";

const title = "Terms of Service | Istano Basa Pagaruyung";
const description = "Terms of service for the independent Istano Basa Pagaruyung guide, including content use, information accuracy, and user responsibility.";
---

<LegalLayout
  {title}
  {description}
  lang="en"
  alternateHref="/terms-of-service/"
  eyebrow="TERMS OF SERVICE"
  heading="Use this as a guide, not a substitute for verification."
  lead="All site content is provided as general orientation material to support visitor planning. Travel decisions, prices, access, and on-site conditions should still be verified through official channels or local staff."
>
  <section>
    <h2>Status of the site</h2>
    <p>This site is an independent, non-profit visitor guide. We are not an official representative of Istano Basa Pagaruyung, local government, the attraction operator, or any commercial business. References to places, services, or business categories are provided as context, not as commercial endorsement.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Accuracy and updates</h2>
    <p>We work to summarise traceable public sources. However, visiting hours, ticket prices, access rules, facilities, weather conditions, and travel circumstances can change at any time. You are responsible for verifying important information before departure or before making travel decisions.</p>
    <p>If you find information that is no longer current, that does not in itself create a guarantee of immediate updates across every page of the site.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Copyright and limitation of liability</h2>
    <p>Original writing, presentation structure, and site design are protected by applicable copyright. Photographs remain subject to the licences or copyrights of their respective owners, as shown in the image credits.</p>
    <p>The site is provided as is for informational purposes. We do not provide a warranty for losses, added costs, or other consequences arising from use of the information in travel planning or travel activity.</p>
  </section>
</LegalLayout>
